<title>DENMARK: Bremer Landesbank set 500 mln Dkk 4-pct, 3-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Bremer Landesbank set 500 mln Dkk 4-pct, 3-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following new bond issue was announced on Wednesday by arrangers BG Bank, Nykredit Bank and UBS Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER - BREMER LANDESBANK   AMT - 500 MLN DANISH CROWNS</p>
<p> COUPON - FOUR PERCENT	MATURITY 20 DECEMBER 20 1999</p>
<p>ISS PRICE - TO BE ADVISED  LAST MOODY'S - AAA1</p>
<p>TO BE LISTED ON COPENHAGEN STOCK EXCHANGE 20 DECEMBER 1996.</p>
<p>Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
